    "body": "I waffled a bit on that front myself; I came to a similar conclusion. My understanding is that no user code should ever see a `Window` object, and so specifying this hook in terms of the `WindowProxy` made sense to me. Editorially I wasn't sure of the best way to write it; thanks for your review. ",
